{"4172640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blade", "steam_appid": 4172640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/4bccfe61526ca403f690d48a79dad40a.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><strong>Core gameplay is rich and diverse, helping you conquer challenges and wander the martial world. Traverse the map to gather various items and resources, enhance your equipment and skills to boost overall combat power. Tame spirit pets to fight alongside you, appraise mysterious accessories to unlock rare affixes that greatly aid your journey. Recruit warriors across the realm as your allies—if recruitment fails, simply offer more gold.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As you explore maps and storylines, completing hidden quests will grant exclusive secret titles to enrich your martial adventure. Additionally, clearing stages, exploring the world, and finishing hidden tasks grant chances to obtain rare armor sets and weapons.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/6a91bd2860d16df7372cd0fc6415e104.poster.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/6a91bd2860d16df7372cd0fc6415e104.webm?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/6a91bd2860d16df7372cd0fc6415e104.mp4?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><u><strong>▌ Core Gameplay: 2D Side-Scrolling Levels · Strategy Is the Key to Victory</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set against the backdrop of the war-torn land of Shu in the late Ming Dynasty, embark on an immersive journey of hardcore 2D side-scrolling challenges. Each level boasts meticulously crafted unique terrain and distinctive level mechanics, completely discarding the mindless brute-force playstyle. Only by making full use of battlefield strategies, mastering precise controls, and above all, taking the core <strong>Shift Dash</strong> mechanic as the key to breaking deadlocks — using its extreme maneuverability to evade mortal dangers, seize the initiative in offense and defense, and break free from terrain constraints — can you shatter all obstacles in your path and charge forward with all your might toward the ultimate secret realm!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/5cf142a2ea1267a9abbbb48516954653.poster.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/5cf142a2ea1267a9abbbb48516954653.webm?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/5cf142a2ea1267a9abbbb48516954653.mp4?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><u><strong>▌ Resource Collection: Foundation of Combat Power · Accumulate on Demand</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core resources are scattered all along your level-clearing journey — <strong>Soul Crystals</strong> can be exchanged for hidden items, while gold coins can purchase functional props. The distribution of these resources holds hidden secrets; some can only be obtained by breaking through terrain restrictions and solving environmental puzzles. Rationally plan your collection routes to lay a solid foundation for subsequent tough challenges!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/52f7ca4fa23d2d0988c1db03bb044fb5.poster.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/52f7ca4fa23d2d0988c1db03bb044fb5.webm?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/52f7ca4fa23d2d0988c1db03bb044fb5.mp4?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><u><strong>▌ BOSS Raids: Exploit Weaknesses · Subdue Foes with Precision</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every boss boasts a unique attack pattern and core weakness. You must observe its movement cadence and skill trajectories to pinpoint vulnerabilities — whether by shattering its weak defensive spots, launching surprise strikes during its charge windows, or triggering weakness-induced staggers with specific items. There are no fixed strategies for victory; only by mastering the boss’s mechanics can you prevail with wit and avoid futile brute-force attempts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/fc1b64eba2dada999aa5d11a649c674d.poster.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/fc1b64eba2dada999aa5d11a649c674d.webm?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/fc1b64eba2dada999aa5d11a649c674d.mp4?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><u><strong>▌Terrain &amp; Items: Utilize the Environment · Turn Peril into Safety</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level terrain is both an obstacle and an advantage: high platforms can be used to flank and pin down enemies, mountain passes can compress the enemy’s attack range, and dynamic hazards such as quicksand and falling rocks can be turned against pursuers. Pair these with a vast array of functional items — explosives to destroy barriers, cover items to temporarily evade damage, and boost potions to enhance combat power for a short time. Combine terrain and items in tandem to unlock diverse clearance strategies and handle all kinds of unexpected battle scenarios.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond that, <i>Soulblade: Dawnbreaker</i> also features <strong>Soul Shrines</strong> (mystical sanctuaries hidden in mountains and rivers), dynamic day-night cycles and celestial phenomena, hidden caches of <strong>Spirit Runes</strong> scattered across the world, and spirit beasts and celestial companions that fight alongside you…</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All of this awaits you to step into this wuxia world personally, and write your own story — <strong>Blade Shadows of a Floating Life</strong>.                            </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/641999f18043332e026de75a8c25b761.avif?t=1781071930\" width=300 height=150 /></span>                                                                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/0c6c992c49986db91a09d1636db96868.poster.avif?t=1781071930\" width=150 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/0c6c992c49986db91a09d1636db96868.webm?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/0c6c992c49986db91a09d1636db96868.mp4?t=1781071930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/ead1579944f0f412e9424d93b211d17f.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/4bccfe61526ca403f690d48a79dad40a.avif?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172640/extras/c68170c0e9d2ed76231c2fe384180296.webp?t=1781071930\" width=1170 height=55 /></span><strong>Core gameplay is rich and diverse, helping you conquer challenges and wander the martial world. Traverse the map to gather various items and resources, enhance your equipment and skills to boost overall combat power. Tame spirit pets to fight alongside you, appraise mysterious accessories to unloc